Verdicts: REAL (meets the rule), LOW (real but below medium severity), PREEXISTING (real but present at base and not newly exposed), NOT_REAL (the claim is wrong), UNCLEAR (cannot decide; say what is missing). Be even-handed: do not assume the reviewers are right or wrong.

